 Makefile                                     | 14 +++-
 perip/sdram/core_sdram_axi4/sdram_axi.v      |  6 +-
 perip/sdram/core_sdram_axi4/sdram_axi_core.v | 78 +++++++-------------
 perip/sdram/sdram.v                          | 67 ++++++++++++++---
